</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>To the Lord belonging,</l><l>Bound I’ll never be,</l><l>For the law of life now</l><l>Sets me wholly free.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Minding flesh no longer,</l><l>I’ll the spirit mind;</l><l>Self-will never follow,</l><l>But the Spirit’s find.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Christ within empow’rs me</l><l>Spiritual to be!</l><l>E’en my body quick’ning</l><l>By His pow’r in me.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Spirit with the spirit</l><l>Witnesseth in one,</l><l>I’m of God begotten,</l><l>Heir with Christ the Son.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
